1
00:00:00,432 --> 00:00:07,852
Imagine this. A man in jail since 2020
wins a global human rights award.

2
00:00:08,112 --> 00:00:10,511
The award came... but will bail come?
Let's decode it.

3
00:00:10,511 --> 00:00:17,531
The award is from Front Line Defenders, an
Irish NGO in Dublin,

4
00:00:17,811 --> 00:00:23,571
given every year since 2005 to human
rights defenders at risk.

5
00:00:24,026 --> 00:00:29,576
This year its Asia-Pacific award went to
Umar Khalid,

6
00:00:29,616 --> 00:00:32,606
held in the Delhi riots conspiracy case.

7
00:00:32,746 --> 00:00:37,116
Police allege a conspiracy, he denies it,
and the case is still pending.

8
00:00:37,786 --> 00:00:40,056
So what is UAPA?

9
00:00:40,376 --> 00:00:44,773
Say it with me: the Unlawful Activities
Prevention Act,

10
00:00:44,813 --> 00:00:50,795
1967. That is, our main anti-terror law.

11
00:00:50,914 --> 00:00:56,214
Its bail rule is Section 43D five.

12
00:00:56,704 --> 00:01:01,614
Charge prima facie, that is at first look,
looks true,

13
00:01:01,704 --> 00:01:09,064
no bail. In the Watali case of 2019, a
Kashmir terror-funding case,

14
00:01:09,104 --> 00:01:14,924
the Supreme Court said judges only check
the police papers at first look,

15
00:01:14,964 --> 00:01:16,844
with no mini trial.

16
00:01:17,205 --> 00:01:21,745
But is it fair to keep someone in jail for
years without a trial?

17
00:01:21,875 --> 00:01:25,615
In the Najeeb case of 2021,

18
00:01:26,025 --> 00:01:30,715
after over five years in jail with the
trial far off,

19
00:01:30,755 --> 00:01:34,585
the Court upheld bail under Article 21.

20
00:01:35,435 --> 00:01:43,028
But for Umar Khalid, in January 2026, it
found a prima facie case and denied bail.

21
00:01:43,068 --> 00:01:46,658
Prelims trap, where many go wrong:

22
00:01:46,698 --> 00:01:51,878
Front Line Defenders is an Irish NGO, not
a UN body,

23
00:01:52,128 --> 00:01:57,788
and the 1998 UN Declaration on defenders
is not binding.

24
00:01:58,495 --> 00:02:01,405
For Mains: liberty versus security,

25
00:02:01,935 --> 00:02:04,955
and speedy trial is the bridge.

26
00:02:05,165 --> 00:02:07,115
One exam trap every day...

27
00:02:07,215 --> 00:02:08,215
follow!
